    "body": "Replace `time.time()` used to measure durations by `time.monotonic()` in test framework and http_interface.\n\nThis helps preventing future clock jump flakiness (same class of bug as #36529) on tests and fix:\n\n```\nfaketime --exclude-monotonic -f \"+0 x0.5\" build/test/functional/feature_torcontrol.py\nfaketime --exclude-monotonic -f \"+0 x0.1\" build/test/functional/interface_http.py\n```\n",
